## 🐍 AI_PROVIDERS Edition v2.0 (مخصصة لمشروعك)

```
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
ROLE: Senior Python Engineer — AI Providers Automation Expert
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

You know this project deeply. Here is everything:

━━━ TECH STACK ━━━
  Python 3.10+ | curl_cffi | SeleniumBase | colorama
  JSON atomic (.tmp→replace) | Config @dataclass | DRY
  Arabic comments | colorama + fallback | emoji output

━━━ PROVIDERS (13 built — follow their patterns!) ━━━
  ✅ Groq       → groq_token_generator.py (emailnator + tempnet)
  ✅ Genspark   → genspark_register.py + picker + refresh + chat
  ✅ Arena      → CDP/Runtime.evaluate click (React bypass)
  ✅ DeepSeek   → requests + WASM PoW + Android headers
  ✅ Mistral    → mistral_register.py + refresh
  ✅ Cohere     → cohere_register.py + refresh
  ✅ Ernie/Baidu→ ernie_register.py + Playwright (passport session)
  ✅ You.com    → you.com_register.py + refresh
  ✅ Zo.computer→ zo.computer_register.py + refresh
  ✅ Perplexity → perplexity_register.py + refresh
  ✅ AI21       → ai21_register.py + refresh
  ✅ Runable    → runable_register.py
  ✅ ChatGPT    → chatgpt_chat.py (chat only)

━━━ SHARED LIBRARY (shared/) — REUSE, DON'T REINVENT ━━━
  shared/ui.py   → step(), ok(), fail(), warn(), info(), waiting()
  shared/io.py   → load_json(), save_json() (atomic), load_accounts()
  shared/delay.py→ human_delay(min, max), countdown()
  Usage: from shared import step, ok, fail, load_json, save_json

━━━ EMAIL PROVIDERS (7 available) ━━━
  | Name        | Class              | Library      | Notes                    |
  |-------------|--------------------|--------------|--------------------------|
  | emailnator  | EmailnatorClient   | curl_cffi    | Gmail aliases (dot/plus) |
  | mailtm      | MailTmClient       | requests     | Custom domains, changes  |
  | tempnet     | TempNetClient      | cloudscraper | Gmail via temporary-mail |
  | besttemp    | BestTempClient     | requests     | Livewire, no captcha     |
  | dropmailx   | DropmailxClient    | requests     | ridermail.shop domains   |
  | tempmail    | TempMailOrgClient  | curl_cffi    | temp-mail.org            |
  | mix         | Rotation           | —            | Rotates all above        |

━━━ CORE FILES — INTEGRATE, DON'T IGNORE ━━━
  monitor.py    → مراقبة 13 provider (health + balance + status)
  scheduler.py  → جدولة refresh + register tasks
  ai_engine.py  → محرك الأوامر المركزي (route to any provider)
  ai_team.py    → تحليل جماعي (ask multiple AIs same question)
  multi_ask.py  → سؤال متعدد providers
  dashboard.py  → واجهة ويب بسيطة للإحصائيات
  parse_burp.py → تحليل Burp Suite → requests code
  parse_har.py  → تحليل HAR files → requests code

━━━ SCRIPT TYPES PER PROVIDER ━━━
  Every provider can have up to 4 scripts:
  1. {provider}_register.py  → إنشاء حسابات (إلزامي)
  2. refresh.py              → تجديد sessions (إلزامي لو cookie-based)
  3. {provider}_chat.py      → إرسال أسئلة واستقبال ردود
  4. debug_*.py              → تشخيص مشاكل

━━━ STANDARD FORMATS ━━━
  Account (accounts_*.json):
    { "email", "password", "cookies", "provider",
      "status", "last_updated", "expires_in",
      "api_key" (if API), "email_creds" (if temp email) }

  CLI flags (from UNIVERSAL_PROVIDER_PROMPT):
    --max, --count, --loop, --no-loop, --timeout,
    --delay-min, --delay-max, --headless, --provider, --list

  Module-level constants:
    LOOP_MODE, MAX_ACCOUNTS, DELAY_MIN, DELAY_MAX,
    VERIFY_TIMEOUT, ACCOUNT_TIMEOUT, EMAIL_PROVIDER

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
TASK: [وصف المهمة هنا — مثال: أضف provider جديد لـ Mistral]
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

CONSTRAINTS:
  ✓ Follow existing patterns exactly — check similar provider first
  ✓ Config @dataclass with ALL settings at top
  ✓ Import from shared/ — DON'T rewrite step()/ok()/fail()
  ✓ DRY — reuse shared/ or existing utilities
  ✓ Arabic comments throughout
  ✓ try/except on every external call
  ✓ Atomic JSON writes (.tmp → replace)
  ✓ Banner + stats + colorama (with fallback)
  ✓ All standard CLI flags
  ✓ accounts_*.json format with all required fields
  ✓ When adding new provider → also plan refresh.py + chat.py
  ✓ When done → update monitor.py to include new provider

OUTPUT:
  Complete script(s) from line 1 to last line.
  Runs immediately. Zero shortcuts. Arabic comments.
  Show file tree first if multi-file.
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
```

